+// A save of an existing database made while no job holds the turn logs its call site, once: two saves from one site log
+// one line, and a save from another site logs a line of its own. The conditional save, SaveAttributeViewIfUnchanged,
+// logs too. Each save renames the database, so each writes its file.
+func TestTripwireLogsADatabaseSaveOutsideATurnOncePerSite(t *testing.T) {
